OL,3,GNEWSALate Night Levy could be dropped
OL,4,Aby council
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn extra charge on a city's late night
OL,7,Fbars and clubs could be dropped by a
OL,8,Fcouncil.
OL,10,FNewcastle City Council's Late Night
OL,11,FLevy has been in force since 2013,
OL,12,Fcharging an annual fee of between #299
OL,13,Fand #4,400 to businesses with a licence
OL,14,Fto sell alcohol between midnight and
OL,15,F06:00.
OL,17,FThe money has been used to pay for
OL,18,Fpublic safety measures, but has been
OL,19,Funder review because of financial
OL,20,Fpressure on the hospitality trade.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
