OL,3,GNEWSALate Night Levy could be dropped
OL,4,Aby council
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,7,FReporting Service (LDRS), council
OL,8,Fchiefs have indicated they want the
OL,9,Fcharge scrapped, as a verdict edges
OL,10,Fcloser.
